# Copy to dashboard/.env.production (note the leading dot) and fill in. Vite reads it during `npm run build`.
# Both values are public by design: the anon/publishable key only identifies the project, and RLS protects the data.
# NEVER put the service_role / secret key here.
#
# Supabase dashboard -> Project Settings -> API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-ANON-OR-PUBLISHABLE-KEY
